  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil on a tava-griddle over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced yellow sweet yams and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the herbes-de-provence, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Continue cooking for an additional 10 minutes, or until the yams are al-dente.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
